ay–night cycle</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Customize Nico with a variety of fun outfits</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Enjoy charming dialogue and a heartfelt story</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Over 20 hours of story content</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/extras/08cc8c9fba8bea7b51cea4b082acbed6.poster.avif?t=1771586818\" width=1170 height=390 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/extras/08cc8c9fba8bea7b51cea4b082acbed6.webm?t=1771586818\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/extras/08cc8c9fba8bea7b51cea4b082acbed6.mp4?t=1771586818\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "short_description": "Sprout Valley is farming simulator game where you can step back from the busy life and grow the garden of your dreams. Captivating story, hand-crafted experience, cute graphics and many more!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, Japanese, Russian<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/header.jpg?t=1771586818", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771586818", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1964820/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771586818", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows Xp, Vista, 7, 8/8.1, 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Dual Core 3.0 Ghz<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2 GB RAM<br></li><l